        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Burton C. Bell, Billy Idol, Perri Lister, John Bechdel\n- Bands and Music Projects: Ascension of The Watchers, Fear Factory, G/Z/R, Ministry, Killing Joke, Prong, Murder, Inc., Visage, Duran Duran\n- Roles: musician, vocalist, singer, songwriter, actor, backing vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol, born William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955, is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Burton C. Bell, born Burton Christopher Bell on February 19, 1969, is an American musician and vocalist.\n- Ascension of The Watchers was started by Burton C. Bell of Fear Factory and G/Z/R and John Bechdel of Ministry, Fear Factory, Killing Joke, Prong, and Murder, Inc.\n- Perri Lister sang backing vocals for Visage and performed in music videos for Duran Duran and Billy Idol.\n- Perri Lister had a nine-year relationship with Billy Idol.",
